The National Federation of Demolition Contractors (NFDC) is a <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_Kingdom">United Kingdom</a> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Construction">construction</a> <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trade_association">trade association</a> representing companies involved in <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Demolition">demolition</a> work.

&nbsp;

The NFDC represents its sector as one of four representative bodies on the <a href="http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/UK_Contractors_Group">UK Contractors Group</a>.
